{'symbol': 'TDG', 'date': '2021-11-16 07:15:00', 'title': 'TRANSDIGM GROUP REPORTS FISCAL 2021 FOURTH QUARTER AND YEAR-END RESULTS', 'text': "CLEVELAND, NOV. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRANSDIGM GROUP INCORPORATED (NYSE: TDG), A LEADING GLOBAL DESIGNER, PRODUCER AND SUPPLIER OF HIGHLY ENGINEERED AIRCRAFT COMPONENTS, TODAY REPORTED RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER\xa030, 2021. FOURTH QUARTER HIGHLIGHTS INCLUDE: NET SALES OF $1,279 MILLION, UP 9% FROM $1,173 MILLION IN THE PRIOR YEAR'S QUARTER; INCOME FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $209 MILLION, UP 107% FROM $101 MILLION; EARNINGS PER SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $3.58, UP 103% FROM $1.76; EBITDA AS DEFINED OF $636 MILLION, UP 28% FROM $498 MILLION; EBITDA AS DEFINED MARGIN OF 49.7%, REPRESENTING SEQUENTIAL IMPROVEMENT; ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $4.25, UP 47% FROM $2.89 IN THE PRIOR YEAR'S QUARTER; AND STRONG OPERATING CASH FLOW GENERATION OF $289 MILLION."}